Port of _patches/typescript/002-checker-checker.patch (tsc/internal/checker/checker.go) to tsrs.

- AfterCheckSourceFileCallback / RegisterAfterCheckSourceFileCallback: tsrs_checker::AfterCheckSourceFileCallback
  (an Arc'd closure behind a process-wide RwLock) and register_after_check_source_file_callback. check_source_file
  calls it once per file, after the file's first full check and before the cancellation check, as Go does.
- Checker.AddDiagnostic: Checker::add_diagnostic_exported (tsrs already has the unexported add_diagnostic).
- Checker.Program: Checker::program (the pub field exists too).
- Checker.GetRelationErrors: Checker::get_relation_errors (needs patches 004 and 005).
- Program.IsSourceFileFromExternalLibrary on the checker's Program trait, implemented by tsrs_compiler::Program and
  by tsrs_ls's aliasResolver (the aliasresolver.go hunk of _patches/typescript/018, which the trait needs).
- tsrs-only: the checker's Program trait has `Any` as a supertrait, so that Effect code can make Go's type assertions
  on a `checker.Program` (internal/typeparser asserts program capabilities; the after-check callback's program is
  the concrete tsrs_compiler::Program, recovered with `downcast_ref`).

Rust-only: tsrs's check_source_file_piece (a heavy declaration file split over several checkers) leaves the relation
errors a piece reports in that piece's checker.

